### Struct Field Shorthand

#### basic struct shorthand

#### uses shorthand for matching variable names

- Verify: uses shorthand for matching variable names


<details>
<summary>Executable SSpec</summary>

Runnable source: 10 lines folded for reproduction.
Reproduction: this block contains the complete executable scenario source.

```simple
step("Verify: uses shorthand for matching variable names")
# @req: REQ-SSPEC-LOCAL-001
struct Point:
    x: i64
    y: i64
val x = 10
val y = 20
val point = Point(x, y)
expect point.x == 10
expect point.y == 20
```

</details>

